      "reason": "The two string arguments pass the type check. With an empty Value and a non-nil old argument, the function returns false before writing. With a nil old argument and no concurrent operations, it publishes the new value and returns true. The test checks both return values and checks that Load returns nil after the first call and \"new\" after the second.",
